siste a 4 · imune a Psíquico</span></div></div><dl class=\"facts\"><div><dt>Origem</dt><dd>Hunt Nv 2.000</dd></div><div><dt>Captura no</dt><dd>Nv 100</dd></div><div><dt>BST</dt><dd>479</dd></div>\n   <div><dt>Ataca com</dt><dd>Físico, usa ATK</dd></div><div><dt>Estágio</dt><dd>Última evolução ou não evolui</dd></div><div><dt>Golpes de 600</dt><dd>2</dd></div></dl>"
    },
    "verdict": {
      "html": "<div class=\"verdict\"><div class=\"pct ok\">+78%</div>\n     <div><p class=\"call\">Fique com ele.</p><p class=\"muted\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">ATK do seu contra um Skuntank médio no mesmo nível. É o stat que define o dano dele.</p></div></div>\n   <div class=\"trio\"><div><small>Resistência vs médio</small><b>+122%</b></div><div><small>ATK do máximo possível</small><b>94%</b></div><div><small>HP de combate</small><b>2.436</b></div></div>"
    },
    "stats": {
      "html": "<div class=\"radar-wrap\"><svg class=\"radar\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 280\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Radar dos stats contra o máximo\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"rg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"var(--t1)\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"var(--t2)\"/></linearGradient></defs>\n    <polygon points=\"150,30 245.26279441628824,85 245.26279441628827,194.99999999999997 150,250 54.73720558371177,195.00000000000003 54.737205583711756,84.99999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,57.5 221.4470958122162,98.75 221.4470958122162,181.25 150,222.5 78.55290418778382,181.25000000000003 78.55290418778381,98.74999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,85 197.6313972081441,112.5 197.63139720814414,167.5 150,195 102.36860279185589,167.50000000000003 102.36860279185588,112.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,112.5 173.81569860407205,126.25 173.81569860407205,153.75 150,167.5 126.18430139592795,153.75 126.18430139592795,126.25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n    <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628824\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628827\" y2=\"194.99999999999997\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.73720558371177\" y2=\"195.00000000000003\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.737205583711756\" y2=\"84.99999999999999\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,84.2 200.7,110.8 198.1,167.8 150.0,197.0 102.4,167.5 103.5,113.1\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink-2)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,-12.9 240.0,88.1 262.5,205.0 150.0,233.7 74.7,183.5 17.1,63.3\" fill=\"url(#rg)\" fill-opacity=\".45\" stroke=\"url(#rg)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">HP</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"k\">ATK</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"209.99999999999997\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">DEF</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SpATK</text><text x=\"35.684646700454124\" y=\"210.00000000000006\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SpDEF</text><text x=\"35.68464670045411\" y=\"77.99999999999999\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SPD</text></svg><div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">HP</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"HP: seu 203, médio 74, máximo 146\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:139.04109589041096%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:50.68493150684932%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(100% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">203</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm key\">ATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"ATK: seu 119, médio 67, máximo 126\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:81.5068493150685%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:45.89041095890411%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(86.3013698630137% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">119</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">DEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"DEF: seu 124, médio 53, máximo 105\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:84.93150684931507%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:36.3013698630137%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(71.91780821917808% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">124</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SpATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpATK: seu 92, médio 56, máximo 108\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:63.013698630136986%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:38.35616438356164%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(73.97260273972603% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">92</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SpDEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpDEF: seu 79, médio 50, máximo 100\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:54.10958904109589%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:34.24657534246575%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(68.4931506849315% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">79</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SPD</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SPD: seu 180, médio 63, máximo 129\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:123.28767123287672%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:43.15068493150685%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(88.35616438356165% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">180</span></div></div></div><p class=\"note\">Contorno tracejado no radar: exemplar médio. O ponto ao lado do nome marca o stat de ataque dele. Resistência é a média de HP, DEF e SpDEF contra o exemplar médio.</p>"
    },
    "imp": {
      "html": "<p style=\"margin:0\">Os golpes de dano dele são físicos: o <b>ATK</b> (base 93) decide o dano. SpATK não ajuda em nada.</p>\n   <div class=\"mins\">\n    <div><small>Qualidade mínima</small><b>1,3</b><span>sai em ~26% das capturas, cerca de 4</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de ATK</small><b>20+</b><span>a média é 16,5</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de HP e DEF</small><b>16+</b><span>define quanto aguenta antes da poção</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de SPD</small><b>livre</b><span>só encurta a recarga</span></div>\n   </div>\n   <div><b>Para comparar dois Skuntank</b><ol class=\"prio\"><li>Maior qualidade.</li><li>Empate de qualidade (até 0,05): maior IV de ATK.</li><li>Depois IV de HP e DEF.</li><li>P2 e P3 desempatam. P4, P5 ou shiny passam na frente de tudo.</li></ol></div>\n   <div class=\"mult\">\n    <div class=\"mlab\"><b>Bate forte</b><small>esses tipos apanham ×2+ dos golpes dele</small></div>\n    <div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#6ba659\"><i></i>Planta<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d996aa\"><i></i>Fada<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#d06688\"><i></i>Psíquico<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#73659a\"><i></i>Fantasma<em>×2</em></span></div>\n    <div class=\"mlab\"><b>Sofre de</b><small>esses tipos batem ×2,5+ nele</small></div>\n    <div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#c4a663\"><i></i>Terra<em>×2,5</em></span></div>\n   </div>"
    },
    "escada": {
      "html": "<p class=\"note\">Skuntank não está no guia de evoluções da comunidade (só Kanto e algumas cadeias). Pelo estágio (última evolução ou não evolui), a regra geral fora de Kanto é: forma do meio no Nv 40, última forma no Nv 100.</p>"
    },
    "hunt-lede": {
      "text": "53 hunts entre o Nv 30 e o Nv 60 simuladas com o seu exemplar. 36 são seguras (no pior intervalo de 5 s ele leva menos de 50% do HP). No topo ficam as que somam mais abates por hora em hunts de nível mais alto, que pagam mais."
    },
